# Cargo
/target

# Runtime data dirs created when a bridge binary/test runs from the repo root.
# .gcore is the default AXVERITY_GCORE_DATA_DIR (objseg segment files, pg_store
# spillover); .axverity holds the enumeration ledger.
/.gcore/
/.axverity/

# CLI `build` outputs when emitted into the repo root instead of a temp dir
# (see compute_lib_path / out_dir in src/main.rs).
/a.out
/lib*.a
/*.rlib
/generated_lib.rs
/generated_main.rs
/generated_*_xb.rs

# Test / bench debris
*.profraw
perf.data
perf.data.old

# Bake-off probe artifacts (M1_VALUE_ALLOCATION_STRATEGY_BAKEOFF_V1).
# The compiled probes and their build logs are regenerable from the harness
# scripts; the CSVs next to them are the measurements and ARE tracked.
/bakeoff-results/bin-*/
/bakeoff-results/*.log
